CM_ BO_ 2147548917 "Ambient Conditions";
CM_ SG_ 2147548917 RoadSurfaceTemperature "Road Surface Temperature: Indicated temperature of road surface over which vehicle is operating.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548917 EngineIntake1AirTemperature "Engine Intake 1 Air Temperature: Temperature of air entering vehicle air induction system.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548917 AmbientAirTemperature "Ambient Air Temperature: Temperature of air surrounding vehicle.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548917 CabInteriorTemperature "Cab Interior Temperature: Temperature of air inside the part of the vehicle that encloses the driver and vehicle operating controls.Note: See also SPN 1691.  SPN 1662 is an additional diagnostic SP associated with cab temperature.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548917 BarometricPressure "Barometric Pressure: Absolute air pressure of the atmosphere.";
CM_ BO_ 2147548918 "Intake/Exhaust Conditions 1";
CM_ SG_ 2147548918 EngnClntFltrDffrntlPrssr "Engine Coolant Filter Differential Pressure: Change in coolant pressure, measured across the filter, due to the filter and any accumulation of solid or semisolid matter on or in the filter.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548918 EngineExhaustTemperature "Engine Exhaust Temperature: Temperature of combustion byproducts leaving the engine.  See SPNs 2433, 2434, 5969 and 5970 for engines with more than one exhaust temperature measurement.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548918 EngnArFltr1DffrntlPrssr "Engine Air Filter 1 Differential Pressure: Change in engine air system pressure, measured across the filter, due to the filter and any accumulation of solid foreign matter on or in the filter.This is the measurement of the first filter in a multiple ...";
CM_ SG_ 2147548918 EngineIntakeAirPressure "Engine Intake Air Pressure: Absolute air pressure at input port to intake manifold.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548918 EngnIntkMnfld1Tmprtr "Engine Intake Manifold 1 Temperature: Temperature of pre-combustion air found in intake manifold of engine air supply system.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548918 EngineIntakeManifold1Pressure "Engine Intake Manifold #1 Pressure: The gage pressure measurement of the air intake manifold. If there are multiple air pressure sensors in the intake stream, this is the last one in flow direction before entering the combustion chamber.  This should...";
CM_ SG_ 2147548918 Atttt1DsPttFtItPssUsSp3609 "Aftertreatment 1 Diesel Particulate Filter Intake Pressure (use SPN 3609): Exhaust pressure as a result of particle accumulation on filter media placed in the exhaust stream.  It is recommended that SPN 3609 be used as it has better resolution.";
CM_ BO_ 2147548919 "Vehicle Electrical Power 1";
CM_ SG_ 2147548919 KeySwitchBatteryPotential "Key Switch Battery Potential: Battery potential measured at the input of the electronic control unit supplied through a key switch or similar switching device.Note:  See SPN 22624 for a discrete state indication of the Key Switch input.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548919 BatteryPotentialPowerInput1 "Battery Potential / Power Input 1: This parameter measures the first source of battery potential as measured at the input of the ECU/actuator etc. coming from one or more batteries, irrespective of the distance between the component and the battery. ...";
CM_ SG_ 2147548919 ChargingSystemPotentialVoltage "Charging System Potential (Voltage): Electrical potential measured at the charging system output.  The charging system may be any device charging the batteries.  This includes alternators, generators, solid state charger and other charging devices.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548919 AlternatorCurrent "Alternator Current: Measure of electrical current flow from the alternator.  Alternator Current (High Range/Resolution) parameter SPN 1795 has a higher range and resolution of the same parameter.";
CM_ SG_ 2147548919 SliBattery1NetCurrent "SLI Battery 1 Net Current: Net flow of electrical current into/out of the first battery or first set of batteries used for starting the engine, for lighting, and for ignition (SLI).  If more than one battery is included in the first set of batteries ...";
